# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is PUBLIC (it is served at kim5425.github.io). Internal working
# notes and session instructions must not be published with it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
NOTES.md

# Throwaway production build made by bin/check-public.ps1 for its pre-deploy scan.
_site_check

# Full-resolution originals kept for re-processing. Not published: the camera files carry
# EXIF (timestamps, camera body serial number) and are far larger than any page needs.
# What ships is the stripped, resized copy beside them.
assets/img/_source/

# Note on generated files that ARE committed: _bibliography/papers.bib, _data/profile.yml,
# _data/socials.yml and assets/pdf/Haesung_Kim_CV.pdf are all produced by
# bin/sync-sot.ps1 from sources outside this repo. The GitHub Actions build only checks
# out this repository, so they have to be present here. Never hand-edit them.

# Publication figures live in the academic record, not here. Only the composed panel
# (assets/img/selected_work.png) is published; bin/make-figure-panel.py reads the
# originals from ../achievements/figures/.
assets/img/publication_preview/

# The record's private block list (achievements/exclude_private.yml) is read from outside
# this repository and must never be copied in: it lists the strings that must not be
# published, so committing it here would publish them. bin/sync-sot.ps1 refuses to run
# while a copy exists; this is the second layer.
exclude_private.yml
